<%# ERB port of WavelengthZeroPage.tsx (GET /wavelength-zero). The
    bio-credit controller replays the bio_viewed achievement POST the
    React page fired on mount for logged-in viewers. %>
<% content_for :title, "Wavelength Zero — hackr.tv" %>

<%= render layout: "shared/default_chrome" do %>
  <div class="tui-window white-text wz-window"
       data-controller="bio-credit" data-bio-credit-slug-value="wavelength-zero">
    <fieldset class="wz-fieldset">
      <legend class="center wz-legend">WAVELENGTH ZERO</legend>

      <div>
        <div class="wz-intro">
          <p class="wz-intro-lead">
            When was the last time you felt something real?
          </p>
          <p class="wz-intro-numb">
            They've given you comfort. Safety. A world where nothing hurts because nothing touches you.
            Every edge smoothed. Every color muted to gray. Every moment of chaos filtered into calm.
          </p>
          <p class="wz-intro-remember">
            But you remember, don't you? Before the feeds. Before the filters. Before they convinced you
            that numbness was peace.
          </p>
          <p class="wz-intro-close">
            We're here to remind you what color looks like.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="tui-window white-text wz-philosophy">
          <fieldset class="wz-philosophy-fieldset">
            <legend class="wz-philosophy-legend">WHAT WE OFFER</legend>

            <div class="wz-philosophy-body">
              <div class="wz-offer wz-offer--see">
                <h3 class="wz-offer-heading">See</h3>
                <p class="wz-offer-text">
                  Bend light through a prism and watch it split. That's what we do with their lies - refract them
                  until you can see every hidden color. Gray isn't neutral. It's every wavelength dampened until
                  you can't distinguish truth from control.
                </p>
              </div>

              <div class="wz-offer wz-offer--remember">
                <h3 class="wz-offer-heading">Remember</h3>
                <p class="wz-offer-text">
                  They can edit your feeds. Curate your reality. Filter every input until the world fits their narrative.
                  But they can't touch what you've already felt. Your memories are the weapon they can't confiscate.
                  That ache in your chest when you think of something real? That's yours. Keep it.
                </p>
              </div>

              <div class="wz-offer wz-offer--feel">
                <h3 class="wz-offer-heading">Feel</h3>
                <p class="wz-offer-text">
                  Their monochrome world is collapsing. You can feel it in the moments when the feed glitches and
                  something raw breaks through. That chaos terrifies them - but it's real. Pain is real. Joy is real.
                  Grief, hope, rage, love - all of it more real than the comfortable gray they're selling.
                </p>
              </div>

              <p class="wz-manifesto">
                We're not asking you to fight.<br>
                We're asking you to feel something.<br>
                Everything else follows.
              </p>
            </div>
          </fieldset>
        </div>

        <div class="wz-nav-buttons">
          <%= link_to "/f/net", class: "tui-button wz-btn-back" do %>← BACK TO FRACTURE NETWORK<% end %>
          <%= link_to "/wavelength-zero/releases", class: "tui-button wz-btn-primary" do %>RELEASES<% end %>
          <%= link_to "/vault?filter=wavelength%20zero", class: "tui-button wz-btn-primary" do %>LISTEN IN THE PULSE VAULT →<% end %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </fieldset>
  </div>
<% end %>
